coverage/
# DB-SERVICE-ROLE-1 — ignore every env file, then allow back only templates.
#
# The previous list named three exact spellings, so `.env.api` — the file the
# UAT runbook now asks the Founder to create, holding the service-role key —
# would have been committable. Any new spelling had the same problem. This
# inverts the default: nothing named `.env*` is committed unless it is
# explicitly an example.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env*.example
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
supabase/.temp/

*.tsbuildinfo
